sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Browser
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant S as Private S3
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Worker
  W->>A: multipart file + bearer token
  A->>A: validate owner, suffix, MIME, signature, size
  A->>S: upload to server-generated key
  S-->>A: success
  A->>D: document row + queued event + outbox job (transaction)
  D-->>A: commit
  A-->>W: 201 metadata (not processing completion)
  P->>D: claim due job and lease
